# Marked Localization Update
# Locale: de (German)
# Feature: Configure Apex sheet + Remove iA Writer annotations
# Generated: 2026-09-21
#
# HOW TO TRANSLATE
# ----------------
# Fill in or correct the string on each line: "key" = "your translation";
# Keep keys unchanged. Do not translate product names (Marked, Apex,
# iA Writer, CriticMarkup, Markdown, HTML, ARIA, CSL, Quarto,
# Python-Markdown) unless your locale already localizes them.
#
# Return this file with translations filled in (same filename).
# We merge with: python3 scripts/merge_localization_updates.py <this-file>

